{'symbol': 'ISRG', 'date': '2022-01-12 09:00:00', 'title': 'INTUITIVE ANNOUNCES PRELIMINARY FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., JAN. 12, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INTUITIVE (THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: ISRG), A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER IN MINIMALLY INVASIVE CARE AND THE PIONEER OF ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY, TODAY ANNOUNCED CERTAIN UNAUDITED PRELIMINARY FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS AHEAD OF ITS PARTICIPATION AT THE 40TH ANNUAL J.P. MORGAN HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE OCCURRING JANUARY 10-13, 2022.'}